That covers all four findings. If Xray still reports commons-codec 1.21.0 after the rebuild, add this dependency under the Redis dependency (the property alone may not override it if it comes through `common-utilities`):

```xml
<dependency>
    <groupId>commons-codec</groupId>
    <artifactId>commons-codec</artifactId>
    <version>1.23.0</version>
</dependency>
```